Marks a section that still needs writing. The bot adds it to new pages; editors replace it with real text.

* <code><nowiki>{{Help write|description}}</nowiki></code> for an empty section
* <code><nowiki>{{Help write|intro}}</nowiki></code> for a missing introduction
* <code><nowiki>{{Help write|obtaining}}</nowiki></code> for how to get an item

Pages using it are listed in [[:Category:Pages needing writing]], which is a good place to find something to write.

